    <briefdescription>
<para>Common QML item contract for data series hosted by <computeroutput>PlotView</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PlotSeries" kindref="compound">PlotSeries</ref> owns the integration shared by every plot type: axis bindings, plot-area layout, data-range reporting, and legend metadata. Concrete series remain responsible for their data model, rendering, and hit testing.</para>
